{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is detected and in range: move, take and process it. Else, if obstacle detected: avoid it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleDetected    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <Action ID = MoveForward    />",
    "BT": {
        "Blackboard": [
            {
                "IsObjectInRange": "Boolean"
            },
            {
                "IsObjectDetected": "Boolean"
            }
        ],
        "Node": {
